ch have at least one non-zero entry below the diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,E=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, they are not upper triangular matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262606 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "444210f3-62f9-5a79-983b-cb130e47cdf7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260470} {:answer/id #uuid "6651e89b-870d-5413-8f00-8d96b56e49c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260766} {:answer/id #uuid "844897da-9608-5dd5-98e7-d4da1a4ec155" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "D=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261025} {:answer/id #uuid "9a74db97-2782-5e50-9e12-0c4456b66a87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261215} {:answer/id #uuid "9f58f91c-fe9e-5c7f-8841-fec1c4d68389" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A=[\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261257}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a74db97-2782-5e50-9e12-0c4456b66a87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "E=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261215} :answer-field/id #uuid "3437cc72-e427-5ac7-afd8-fe2d376e33a5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262218}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8edd360b-8c0f-5c8f-b5f1-4655b27f3fa4" :question/math-academ